<body data-time="all">
  <header class="site"><div class="wrap bar"><a class="brand" href="/">Vault <b>Human</b></a><nav class="navlinks" id="navlinks"><a href="/method/">The approach</a><div class="navdrop"><button class="navdrop__btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true">Your life <span aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button><div class="navdrop__menu"><a href="/as-learned/">Learning your past</a><a href="/as-loved/">Loving your present</a><a href="/as-lived/">Living your future</a></div></div><a href="/speaking/">About Russ</a><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin</a></nav><button class="navtoggle" type="button" aria-label="Open menu" aria-controls="navlinks" aria-expanded="false"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button></div></header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero hero-plain"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">The 360 · keys for the mind</p>
      <h1>Three hundred sixty keys. <em>Each in its place.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">The best ideas people have found for living well, each placed in the part of your life where it helps most. Your coach brings them to you, one at a time.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin with Vault</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#chambers">See the chambers</a></div>
    </div></div></section>
    <section class="sec" style="padding-top:20px"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="ck-steps">
        <div><span>01</span><b>It arrives</b><p>A two-minute lesson from your coach each morning, from the chamber you're in.</p></div>
        <div><span>02</span><b>You use it</b><p>One thing to do today: a practice, a call, a conversation, a walk.</p></div>
        <div><span>03</span><b>You log it</b><p>One line: what you did and what it did.</p></div>
        <div><span>04</span><b>It turns</b><p>When it becomes a habit, the key turns and the gate swings open.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>
    <section class="sec" style="padding-top:20px"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">The Vault Approach</p><h2>360 keys. Eleven rooms.</h2><p class="lede">Start with you. The keys open the gates.</p></div>
